        "question": "The y-intercept of the line 2x − 3y + 6 = 0 is:",
        "options": [
            "A):   −2",
            "B):   2",
            "C):   3",
            "D):   −3"
        ],
        "correctAnswer": "B",
        "explanation": "3y = 2x + 6 ⇒ y = (2/3)x + 2. Thus, the y-intercept c = 2."
